       The  functions  [1mvprintf[22m(), [1mvfprintf[22m(), [1mvdprintf[22m() are equivalent to the functions [1mprintf[22m(), [1mfprintf[22m(), [1mdprintf[22m(), respectively, except that they are called with a [4mva_list[24m instead of a variable number of arguments.  These functions do not call the [4mva_end[24m macro.  Because they invoke the [4mva_arg[24m macro, the value of
       [4map[24m is undefined after the call.  See [1mstdarg[22m(3).

